        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami wakaambila Joabu silutwe wampi ngwaa-kali awe kuti, Koya bwiinda akati kamikowa yoonse ya-Israyeli, kuzwa kuDani akusikila ku-Beereseba, mukabale bantu, nkazibe mweelwe wabantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Joabu wakaambila mwami kuti, Jehova Leza wako avuzye bantu kut, kufumbwa mweelwe wabo mbuubede sunu, bainde nguwo ziindi zili mwaanda. Meso aamwami simalelaangu abone cintu eci naacipona. Pele nkaambonzi mwami simalelaangu ulayanda kucita mbwaamba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
