        {
          "text": "Lino Davida wakaambila Gadi kuti, Moyo wangu wama akati kamapenzi mapati. Lino atwaabwe mumaanza aa-Jehova, nkaambo luzyalo lwakwe ndupati, pele intaabwi mumaanza aabantu pe. ",
