        {
          "text": "Pele angelo naakatambika ijanza lyakwe kuti anyonyoone Jerusalemu, Jehova wakausa insoni, wakaambila oyo angelo iwakali kujaya bantu kuti, Mbubo, kolesya ijanza lyako. Nkabela angelo kali kufwaafwi kucipolelo ca-Amuna mu-Jebusi.",
